      "dcterms:title": "Isothermal grain growth kinetics in sintered UO2 pellets",
      "dcterms:description": "Grain growth rates measured on twelve types of UO2 specimen, mainly between 1300 and 1500 °C, interpreted with a Burke-type rate equation in which growth continues only up to a temperature-dependent limiting grain size. The correlation is extended to irradiated UO2 by letting the limiting size decrease with burn-up.",
      "dcterms:format": "application/pdf",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "J. B. Ainscough",
        "B. W. Oldfield",
        "J. O. Ware"
      ],
