      "dcterms:description": "Proposes a multi-fidelity methodology for coupling a meso-scale fission gas module (SCIANTIX) to a fuel performance code (FRAPCON) when a required input, the local hydrostatic stress, is not predicted by that code. A neural network trained on TRANSURANUS results fills the gap; demonstrated on the Risø AN3 irradiation experiment.",
