      "dcterms:title": "On the use of spectral algorithms for the prediction of short-lived volatile fission product release: Methodology for bounding numerical error",
      "dcterms:description": "Examines spectral diffusion algorithms, which project the solution onto the eigenfunctions of the Laplacian, for predicting short-lived volatile fission product release. Derives an upper bound on the numerical error in constant and time-varying conditions, as a function of the number of modes and of the time discretisation.",
